ical_prompt_or_task_scaffold\"\ndocs/input-representation-atlas/data/atlas.json:1159:      ],\ndocs/input-representation-atlas/data/atlas.json:1160:      \"modalities\": [\ndocs/input-representation-atlas/data/atlas.json:1161:        \"single-cell transcriptomic data\"\ndocs/input-representation-atlas/data/atlas.json:1162:      ],\ndocs/input-representation-atlas/data/atlas.json:1163:      \"lifecycle_phases\": [\ndocs/input-representation-atlas/data/atlas.json:1164:        \"fine_tuning\"\ndocs/input-representation-atlas/data/atlas.json:1165:      ],\ndocs/input-representation-atlas/data/atlas.json:1166:      \"fusion_topologies\": [\ndocs/input-representation-atlas/data/atlas.json:1167:        \"retrieval_or_tool_context\"\ndocs/input-representation-atlas/data/atlas.json:1168:      ],\ndocs/input-representation-atlas/data/atlas.json:1169:      \"text_roles\": [\ndocs/input-representation-atlas/data/atlas.json:1170:        \"instruction_or_query\"\ndocs/input-representation-atlas/data/atlas.json:1171:      ],\ndocs/input-representation-atlas/data/atlas.json:1172:      \"figure\": {\ndocs/input-representation-atlas/data/atlas.json:1173:        \"asset\": \"assets/figures/full_2026_07_06_rec_003008_figure_006.png\",\ndocs/input-representation-atlas/data/atlas.json:1174:        \"source_path\": \"data/docling_include_vlm_52_2026-07-10_nolimits/figures/full_2026_07_06_rec_003008/figure_006.png\",\ndocs/input-representation-atlas/data/atlas.json:1175:        \"figure_index\": 6,\ndocs/input-representation-atlas/data/atlas.json:1176:        \"caption\": \"Figure 6: Workflow for extracting biological embeddings from LLM-BFT. a : LLM-BFT generates profile texts for entities of interest (e.g., a specific gene). The gene profile text is encoded by OpenAI TEXT-EMBEDDING-ADA-002 (the same text encoder GenePT uses) to obtain gene embeddings, so that GenePT (GPT-4o + ada-002) and LLM-BFT (BFT-70B + ada-002) differ only in the LLM that produces the profile text. b : For a single-cell dataset, gene embeddings are weighted by gene expression values to generate cell embeddings.\",\ndocs/input-representation-atlas/data/atlas.json:1177:        \"description\": \"SCIENTIFIC_FIGURE\\n\\nWorkflow/model architecture schematic with two labeled panels, **a** and **b**. Panel **a** shows an LLM-based gene text embedding pipeline: a user prompt (“Tell me about gene.”) is processed by **LLM-BFT**, producing an LLM response with gene name/function/interaction text; texts for gene x through gene y are converted via **Text to embedding** into a **gene embedding (N, 2048)** matrix. Panel **b** shows a cell-by-gene expression matrix for **M cells** and **N genes** multiplied by the **gene embedding (N, 2048)** matrix to produce a **cell embedding (M, 2048)** matrix. Main visible message: gene-level text embeddings are derived from LLM responses and combined with gene expression data to generate cell embeddings.\",\ndocs/input-representation-atlas/data/atlas.json:1178:        \"page_no\": 17,\ndocs/input-representation-atlas/data/atlas.json:1179:        \"selection_score\": 25,\ndocs/input-representation-atlas/data/atlas.json:1180:        \"selection_reasons\": [\ndocs/input-representation-atlas/data/atlas.json:1181:          \"1 model-name tokens match\",\ndocs/input-representation-atlas/data/atlas.json:1182:          \"architecture/workflow figure\"\ndocs/input-representation-atlas/data/atlas.json:1183:        ],\ndocs/input-representation-atlas/data/atlas.json:1184:        \"sha256\": \"67fe2b141b93b9a815f32760e23a012c60448a40791b7aff45cdac4c51d4f7ef\"\ndocs/input-representation-atlas/data/atlas.json:1185:      },\ndocs/input-representation-atlas/data/atlas.json:1186:      \"routes\": [\ndocs/input-representation-atlas/data/atlas.json:1187:        {\ndocs/input-representation-atlas/data/atlas.json:1188:          \"route_id\": \"route_bee85a77ca8f\",\ndocs/input-representation-atlas/data/atlas.json:1189:          \"configuration_id\": \"config_0c522054845a\"