53:        \"biological_payload\"\ndocs/input-representation-atlas/data/atlas.json:31054:      ],\ndocs/input-representation-atlas/data/atlas.json:31055:      \"figure\": {\ndocs/input-representation-atlas/data/atlas.json:31056:        \"asset\": \"assets/figures/full_2026_07_06_rec_001200_figure_001.png\",\ndocs/input-representation-atlas/data/atlas.json:31057:        \"source_path\": \"data/docling_include_vlm_52_2026-07-10_nolimits/figures/full_2026_07_06_rec_001200/figure_001.png\",\ndocs/input-representation-atlas/data/atlas.json:31058:        \"figure_index\": 1,\ndocs/input-representation-atlas/data/atlas.json:31059:        \"caption\": \"Fig. 1 Overview of Shusi. a, Pipeline for constructing single-cell protein interaction networks from scRNA-seq data. b, Architecture of the Shusi model for predicting novel interactions on single cell level. d, Fine-tuning and application of Shusi to AML patient scRNA-seq data.\",\ndocs/input-representation-atlas/data/atlas.json:31060:        \"description\": \"SCIENTIFIC_FIGURE\\n\\nMulti-panel workflow/model architecture figure with panels labeled **a**, **b**, and **c**.\\n\\nPanel **a** shows **data collection and preprocessing** for **scRNA-seq** and protein/network data: “23 cancer types, 234 cell lines,” “12,350 proteins,” an experimentally validated **STRING-E** network, a t-SNE-like scRNA-seq plot, and construction of **75,010 networks**.\\n\\nPanel **b** shows **model training**: a **large language model** encodes amino acid sequences and functional descriptions into protein embeddings, then a **variational graph autoencoder** with a **GIN encoder**, latent variable **Z**, and decoder performs graph isomorphism/network link prediction for cell-specific networks.\\n\\nPanel **c** shows **drug target identification** using a “Shushi Model,” fine-tuning on **AML patient scRNA-seq**, link prediction, target identification, and experimental validation.\\n\\nMain visible finding/message: the figure presents an end-to-end computational pipeline connecting cancer scRNA-seq, protein language-model embeddings, graph neural network link prediction, and drug target discovery/validation.\",\ndocs/input-representation-atlas/data/atlas.json:31061:        \"page_no\": 5,\ndocs/input-representation-atlas/data/atlas.json:31062:        \"selection_score\": 185,\ndocs/input-representation-atlas/data/atlas.json:31063:        \"selection_reasons\": [\ndocs/input-representation-atlas/data/atlas.json:31064:          \"1 model-name tokens match\",\ndocs/input-representation-atlas/data/atlas.json:31065:          \"architecture/workflow figure\",\ndocs/input-representation-atlas/data/atlas.json:31066:          \"model name appears in figure text\",\ndocs/input-representation-atlas/data/atlas.json:31067:          \"route cites this figure number\"\ndocs/input-representation-atlas/data/atlas.json:31068:        ],\ndocs/input-representation-atlas/data/atlas.json:31069:        \"sha256\": \"096db91d754e4ab3949e466a513debdf24ed09c17b9d18d33ee4249263b28c35\"\ndocs/input-representation-atlas/data/atlas.json:31070:      },\ndocs/input-representation-atlas/data/atlas.json:31071:      \"routes\": [\ndocs/input-representation-atlas/data/atlas.json:31072:        {\ndocs/input-representation-atlas/data/atlas.json:31073:          \"route_id\": \"route_5995cf37407f\",\ndocs/input-representation-atlas/data/atlas.json:31074:          \"configuration_id\": \"config_4ff6c3f2b5bd\",\ndocs/input-representation-atlas/data/atlas.json:31075:          \"route_label\": \"Pretraining: amino acid sequences\",\ndocs/input-representation-atlas/data/atlas.json:31076:          \"lifecycle_phase\": \"pretraining\",\ndocs/input-representation-atlas/data/atlas.json:31077:          \"task_or_configuration_verbatim\": \"feature extraction module\",\ndocs/input-representation-atlas/data/atlas.json:31078:          \"source_object_verbatim\": \"amino acid sequences\",\ndocs/input-representation-atlas/data/atlas.json:31079:          \"source_